"LoadImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [5, 22], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [454.0895080566406, 337.1842041015625], "pos": [64.18328094482422, 439.4994201660156], "widgets_values": ["", "The image is a high-quality photograph of a perfume bottle placed on a large, textured rock in a vibrant, sunlit meadow. The perfume bottle, positioned centrally, has a rectangular shape with slightly rounded edges and a transparent, glass-like appearance. The bottle is filled with a golden amber liquid and features a clear, rectangular, faceted cap with a metallic silver finish. A white label with black text reads \"Flor d'Oranga\" and includes the phrase \"Essence de Fleurs\" along with the volume \"50ml.\" Surrounding the bottle are bright orange marigold flowers and white daisies with yellow centers, their petals slightly blurred to emphasize depth of field. The background showcases a clear, bright blue sky with a few fluffy white clouds, enhancing the sunny, cheerful atmosphere. The rock on which the bottle rests is light brown and has a rough, textured surface. The overall composition is bright and colorful, with a natural, outdoor setting that evokes a sense of freshness and simplicity. The photograph uses a shallow depth of field to keep the focus on the perfume bottle while the surrounding flora is softly blurred."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 4, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [312.2679443359375, 248.2139129638672], "pos": [648.2666625976562, 513.56396484375], "widgets_values": ["", "该图像是一张高质量的照片，上面放在一个充满活力的阳光草地上的大型质感岩石上。香水瓶的位置位于中央，其矩形形状略有圆形边缘和透明的玻璃样外观。该瓶子充满了金色琥珀色的液体，并配有透明，矩形，刻面盖，并带有金属银色饰面。带有黑色文字的白色标签上写着“ Flor d'Oranga”，其中包括“ Essence de Fleurs”一词和“ 50毫升”。瓶子周围是明亮的橙色万寿菊花和带有黄色中心的白色雏菊，它们的花瓣略微模糊以强调景深。背景展示了晴朗，明亮的蓝天，上面有一些蓬松的白色云层，增强了阳光明媚，开朗的氛围。瓶子静置的岩石是浅棕色，具有粗糙的质感表面。整体构图是明亮多彩的，具有自然的户外环境，唤起了新鲜感和简单的感觉。这张照片使用浅景深，在周围的植物群变模时，将注意力集中在香水瓶上。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 6, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [6], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [424.88970947265625, 262.4027099609375], "pos": [583.4411010742188, 134.98338317871094], "widgets_values": ["english", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 5, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [23], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [315, 106], "pos": [597.6823120117188, 1811.093017578125], "widgets_values": [768, 1024, 1], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [10], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [315, 262], "pos": [1050, 1200], "widgets_values": [686421793212541, "randomize", 20, 1, "euler", "normal", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 13, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 14, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDIT